{"route":"/docs/5.0/utilities/float/","version":"5.0","renderedVersion":"5.0","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Float","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Toggle floats on any element, across any breakpoint, using our responsive float utilities."},"blocks":[{"id":"overview","type":"heading","en":"Overview","level":2},{"id":"overview--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"These utility classes float an element to the left or right, or disable floating, based on the current viewport size using the <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/float\">CSS <code>float</code> property</a>. <code>!important</code> is included to avoid specificity issues. These use the same viewport breakpoints as our grid system. Please be aware float utilities have no effect on flex items."},{"id":"overview--example-1","type":"demo","key":"601e9f522b42c0dd2a42","height":300},{"id":"overview--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"float-start\">Float start on all viewport sizes</div><br>\n<div class=\"float-end\">Float end on all viewport sizes</div><br>\n<div class=\"float-none\">Don't float on all viewport sizes</div>","language":"html"},{"id":"responsive","type":"heading","en":"Responsive","level":2},{"id":"responsive--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Responsive variations also exist for each <code>float</code> value."},{"id":"responsive--example-1","type":"demo","key":"fde3cf6cae8a1225611d","height":300},{"id":"responsive--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"float-sm-start\">Float start on viewports sized SM (small) or wider</div><br>\n<div class=\"float-md-start\">Float start on viewports sized MD (medium) or wider</div><br>\n<div class=\"float-lg-start\">Float start on viewports sized LG (large) or wider</div><br>\n<div class=\"float-xl-start\">Float start on viewports sized XL (extra-large) or wider</div><br>","language":"html"},{"id":"responsive--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Here are all the support classes:"},{"id":"responsive--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-1","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-start</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-2","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-end</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-3","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-none</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-4","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-sm-start</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-5","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-sm-end</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-6","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-sm-none</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-7","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-md-start</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-8","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-md-end</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-9","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-md-none</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-10","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-lg-start</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-11","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-lg-end</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-12","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-lg-none</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-13","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-xl-start</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-14","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-xl-end</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-15","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-xl-none</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-16","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-xxl-start</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-17","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-xxl-end</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-18","type":"item","en":"<code>.float-xxl-none</code>"}]}]},{"id":"sass","type":"heading","en":"Sass","level":2},{"id":"utilities-api","type":"heading","en":"Utilities API","level":3},{"id":"utilities-api--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Float utilities are declared in our utilities API in <code>scss/_utilities.scss</code>. <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/utilities/api/#using-the-api\">Learn how to use the utilities API.</a>"},{"id":"utilities-api--code-1","type":"code","value":"    \"float\": (\n      responsive: true,\n      property: float,\n      values: (\n        start: left,\n        end: right,\n        none: none,\n      )\n    ),","language":"scss"}],"demos":[{"key":"601e9f522b42c0dd2a42","html":"\n<div class=\"float-start\">Float start on all viewport sizes</div><br>\n<div class=\"float-end\">Float end on all viewport sizes</div><br>\n<div class=\"float-none\">Don't float on all viewport sizes</div>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"fde3cf6cae8a1225611d","html":"\n<div class=\"float-sm-start\">Float start on viewports sized SM (small) or wider</div><br>\n<div class=\"float-md-start\">Float start on viewports sized MD (medium) or wider</div><br>\n<div class=\"float-lg-start\">Float start on viewports sized LG (large) or wider</div><br>\n<div class=\"float-xl-start\">Float start on viewports sized XL (extra-large) or wider</div><br>\n","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/download/"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/contents/"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/browsers-devices/"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/javascript/"},{"en":"Build tools","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/build-tools/"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/webpack/"},{"en":"Parcel","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.0/getting-started/parcel/"},{"en":"Acc